# HelloCs in a real Avalonia window, put off every display and never activated (drive.cs.OffScreen).
# tools/selftest-cs.mjs window builds and launches it: dotnet bin/hello-cs/bin/Debug/net10.0/HelloCs.dll
# DRIVE_VISIBLE=1 puts the window on a display for a human to watch (it still takes no focus).
# -cp src instead of -lib heaps-drive, so it builds this checkout whichever one haxelib points at.
-cp src
-cp examples
-lib haxeui-core
-lib haxeui-cs
-D haxeui_cs_drive
-D drive
-main HelloCs
-cs bin/hello-cs
-w -WAll
